1
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:06,700
Sorry I'm late. Did I miss anything?
抱歉遲到了 有錯過什麼精彩好戲嗎？

2
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:09,560
Joey stuffing fifteen Oreos in his mouth.
喬伊在嘴裡塞了15片餅乾

3
00:00:10,970 --> 00:00:11,960
Fifteen?
15片？

4
00:00:12,210 --> 00:00:14,140
Your personal best!
刷新個人紀錄哦

5
00:00:19,050 --> 00:00:20,410
Where were you?
你到哪兒去了？

6
00:00:20,650 --> 00:00:21,640
On a date.
約會

7
00:00:21,820 --> 00:00:24,340
I met this girl on a train going to a museum upstate.
我去逛博物館 在火車上認識了一個女孩

8
00:00:24,650 --> 00:00:27,490
-Which museum? -How'd you meet her?
哪間博物館？ 你是怎麼認識她的？

9
00:00:27,890 --> 00:00:29,790
No. Answer his.
回答他的問題比較好

10
00:00:30,690 --> 00:00:32,890
We were at the back of the train.
我們坐在車廂最後面

11
00:00:33,130 --> 00:00:36,460
I sat near the door so she'd have to pass by me...
我的座位靠門 

12
00:00:36,730 --> 00:00:40,630
...if she wanted to switch cars. She was totally at my mercy.
她要換車的話得先經過我 她得任由我擺佈

14
00:00:40,900 --> 00:00:44,170
Were you so late because you were burying this woman?
你遲到是因為 在埋她的屍體嗎？

15
00:00:44,570 --> 00:00:46,940
I'm late because she lives in Poughkeepsie.
我遲到是因為她住在波啟浦夕

16
00:00:47,140 --> 00:00:50,540
She seems great, but she's two and a half hours away.
她人很好，可惜住得太遠

17
00:00:50,810 --> 00:00:54,180
How can she be great if she's from Poughkeepsie?
她是波啟浦夕人 怎麼可能好到哪兒去？

18
00:00:55,420 --> 00:00:57,720
That joke would have killed in Albany.
這個笑話在艾爾班尼 會搏得滿堂彩

19
00:00:58,750 --> 00:01:00,690
Done! I did it.
成功！

20
00:01:01,490 --> 00:01:03,350
Who's stupid now?
還覺得我是個傻蛋嗎？

21
00:01:05,790 --> 00:01:07,890
The One with the Girl From Poughkeepsie
本集播出：亂點鴛鴦譜

00:01:09,790 --> 00:01:10,890
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

22
00:01:53,270 --> 00:01:56,110
Look! They're lighting the big Christmas tree tonight.
看，今天是聖誕樹的點燈之夜

23
00:01:56,380 --> 00:01:58,310
That paper is two weeks old.
那是兩周前的報紙耶

24
00:02:00,150 --> 00:02:02,950
Who keeps leaving old newspapers in the trash?
是誰老是把舊報紙 丟在垃圾桶裡的？

25
00:02:05,550 --> 00:02:08,220
I really wanted to take Kathy to this.
人家好想帶凱西去看

26
00:02:08,420 --> 00:02:11,550
At least you have somebody to miss stuff with.
至少你還有伴和你一起錯過

28
00:02:12,230 --> 00:02:13,990
I hate being alone this time of year.
我討厭過節時孤伶伶的

29
00:02:14,460 --> 00:02:16,330
Next it's Valentine's Day...
情人節、

30
00:02:16,560 --> 00:02:18,500
...then my birthday,then bang!
我的日生轉眼就到 然後…

31
00:02:18,770 --> 00:02:22,070
Before you know it,they're lighting that damn tree again.
他們又要點亮那棵 討厭的聖誕樹

32
00:02:22,800 --> 00:02:25,240
I want somebody!
我想找個伴

33
00:02:28,310 --> 00:02:30,970
You know,I want a man!
我想找個男人

34
00:02:35,780 --> 00:02:40,120
It doesn't even have to be a big relationship. Just a fling!
我不想談轟轟烈烈的戀愛 來段露水姻緣就好了

36
00:02:40,320 --> 00:02:43,450
I didn't think girls ever just wanted a fling.
沒想到你也想要露水姻緣

37
00:02:43,660 --> 00:02:47,650
Let me tell you,it's been a long time since I've been flung.
告訴你，我缺水缺得可久了

38
00:02:49,100 --> 00:02:51,360
I know what I'm giving you for Christmas.
那我知道聖誕節要送你什麼了

39
00:02:55,100 --> 00:02:58,800
There are nice guys in my office. Want me to set you up?
我有幾個同事挺不錯的 要不要幫你介紹一下？

40
00:02:59,270 --> 00:03:03,470
I've been single a long time. Why haven't you offered before?
我單身了好一陣子 你以前怎麼沒提出這個建議？

41
00:03:03,710 --> 00:03:06,340
I have a girlfriend. I'm happy.
我現在有女朋友，很快樂

42
00:03:06,850 --> 00:03:11,220
I no longer go out of my way to stop others from being happy.
不需要再處心積慮 破壞別人的好事

43
00:03:12,550 --> 00:03:14,020
Okay.
好

44
00:03:14,220 --> 00:03:15,350
No accountants.
我不要會計師

45
00:03:15,560 --> 00:03:18,890
And no one from "legal." I don't like boring jobs.
也不要法律部門的人 我不喜歡工作無聊的男人

46
00:03:19,160 --> 00:03:22,650
And Ross was what? A lion tamer?
難不成羅斯是訓獸師嗎？

48
00:03:26,770 --> 00:03:28,200
What's wrong,Mon?
怎麼回事？

49
00:03:28,500 --> 00:03:30,270
Everybody at work still hates me.
餐廳裡的人 還是把我視為眼中釘

50
00:03:30,410 --> 00:03:33,840
Is it because of the review you wrote or something new?
是因為你寫的評論 還是有新的原因？

51
00:03:34,610 --> 00:03:36,630
It's the review.
一定是因為那篇評論

52
00:03:37,180 --> 00:03:38,340
I was making headway.
我還以為漸入佳境 

53
00:03:38,580 --> 00:03:41,780
Everyone was smiling at me, and then I get off work...
大家都衝著我微笑 下班後才發現 

54
00:03:42,020 --> 00:03:45,180
...and find out they wrote this on my chef's hat.
他們在我帽子上寫了這個…

55
00:03:46,459 --> 00:03:48,723
「婊子，快辭職！」

56
00:03:48,920 --> 00:03:52,950
Maybe they meant to write "Quiet,Bitch."
也許他們想寫的是 「婊子，快住嘴」

57
00:03:58,130 --> 00:04:00,230
What's the matter?
怎麼了？

58
00:04:00,670 --> 00:04:02,570
Fine! Just trying to be nice.
幹嘛？火氣這麼大

59
00:04:05,070 --> 00:04:07,970
I haven't been picked on this much since kindergarten.
我幼稚園畢業後 就沒受過這等鳥氣

60
00:04:08,240 --> 00:04:12,940
And they brought in someone from junior high to do the see-saw with me.
當時他們找了個高中生 來跟我玩翹翹板

61
00:04:18,250 --> 00:04:21,950
They're trying to make me quit. If it were any other job,I would.
他們無所不用其極的 想逼我辭職 換做是別的工作我早就不幹了

62
00:04:22,160 --> 00:04:24,350
But I've waited for this my whole life.
但我等當主廚等了大半輩子

64
00:04:24,760 --> 00:04:28,390
Wait,you're the boss. Yell at them. Or fire them!
等等，你是老大 你為什麼不吼他們 或乾脆炒了他們？

66
00:04:28,830 --> 00:04:33,200
I would love to,but I can't. I'm not good at confrontation.
我也很想這樣 但我最不會處理衝突場面

67
00:04:33,470 --> 00:04:34,660
You know what you can do?
你知道你要怎麼做？

68
00:04:34,940 --> 00:04:38,130
I read about this director, Orson Welles...
名導奧森威爾斯在片子開拍前

69
00:04:38,440 --> 00:04:42,380
...who,at the beginning,would hire somebody just to fire them.
都會刻意花錢請一個人

70
00:04:42,680 --> 00:04:45,310
Then they would all know who was boss.
為的就是當著大家的面開除他 好殺雞儆猴

71
00:04:47,350 --> 00:04:49,820
I'm not doing anything. Why not fire me?
我反正沒事 你乾脆開除我算了

72
00:04:51,950 --> 00:04:54,440
It's a good idea. Can you waiter?
好主意 你知道怎麼當服務生嗎？

73
00:04:54,690 --> 00:04:56,490
Good enough to get fired.
反正你要開除我 管那麼多幹嘛

74
00:04:57,530 --> 00:04:59,250
All right. You're hired!
好，我決定用你了

75
00:05:01,760 --> 00:05:06,760
That's why I got fired last week! Does Orson Welles direct commercials?
難怪我上個禮拜被開除 奧森威爾斯導不導廣告片？

77
00:05:11,970 --> 00:05:13,440
Yes.
有

78
00:05:23,120 --> 00:05:26,110
I say,Drew? Are you seeing anybody right now?
德魯，你有在跟誰交往嗎？

79
00:05:26,650 --> 00:05:28,350
I'm not asking for me.
我不是幫我自己問啦

80
00:05:29,960 --> 00:05:32,290
I'm not gay. I'm not asking you out.
我不是同志，不是在約你

81
00:05:32,490 --> 00:05:34,150
I'm not gay.
我不是同志

82
00:05:34,660 --> 00:05:36,600
I didn't think you were gay.
我以前沒把你當同志 不過現在覺得有點像

83
00:05:36,800 --> 00:05:38,320
I do now.

84
00:05:40,970 --> 00:05:43,700
My friend,Rachel, wants to be set up.
我朋友瑞秋 希望我幫她介紹個男人

85
00:05:44,110 --> 00:05:46,540
I just got out of a big relationship.
我才剛剛跟前女友分手 

86
00:05:46,770 --> 00:05:48,670
I'm not looking to get serious.
還沒準備好要談感情

87
00:05:48,940 --> 00:05:52,280
That's okay. A fling might be all right with her.
就算只是春風一度也沒關係 瑞秋不會有意見的

88
00:05:52,480 --> 00:05:56,880
Is this "Hot Rachel" that you took to the Christmas Party?
等等… 你說的是來參加耶誕派對的 火辣瑞秋嗎？

90
00:05:57,290 --> 00:05:59,620
By the way,that is her full name.
沒錯，那就是她的本名

91
00:06:00,290 --> 00:06:01,950
Wow! I'm free for her.
我有空，幫我介紹一下吧

92
00:06:02,190 --> 00:06:04,620
Wait,I didn't say I wasn't free.
等等，我又沒說我沒空

93
00:06:05,630 --> 00:06:07,650
Let's talk it over at the Ranger game.
這樣吧，咱們邊看球賽邊聊

94
00:06:08,300 --> 00:06:11,060
Hold on. I just got a box of Cubans.
我有一盒古巴雪茄 

95
00:06:11,300 --> 00:06:13,730
I'll bring them by your office at five.
我五點鐘拿到你辦公室去

96
00:06:14,700 --> 00:06:18,870
That's a little later than I usually stay,but sure.
我平常不會待到這麼晚 不過可以破個例

97
00:06:19,070 --> 00:06:23,010
Before the game,we could enjoy some eight-year-old Basil Haydens.
咱們在看球賽之前 可以先喝上兩杯 陳年海登威士忌

99
00:06:23,680 --> 00:06:28,670
I don't know what that is, but that's a pretty nice jacket.
天曉得那是什麼東東 不過你的外套我看了挺順眼的

101
00:06:32,690 --> 00:06:35,420
Kind of like that tie too.
領帶也不錯

102
00:06:37,990 --> 00:06:40,390
Keep your pants on,man.
褲子就不必了

103
00:06:46,500 --> 00:06:50,940
I'm writing a holiday song for everyone. Do you want to hear it?
我為大家寫了首聖誕歌 想不想聽？

104
00:06:56,240 --> 00:06:59,480
Happy Hanukkah,Monica
摩妮卡，光明節快樂

105
00:07:01,520 --> 00:07:04,640
May your Christmas be snowy,Joey
喬伊，願你聖誕節瑞雪紛飛

106
00:07:05,290 --> 00:07:07,750
Happy New Year,Chandler and Ross
錢德、羅斯，新年快樂

107
00:07:08,020 --> 00:07:11,290
Spin the dreidel,Rachel
瑞秋，快來玩陀螺

108
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:16,520
Pheebs,that's great!
真好聽

109
00:07:16,760 --> 00:07:20,670
But you know, Rachel doesn't rhyme with dreidel.
但是瑞秋跟陀螺不押韻

110
00:07:21,270 --> 00:07:25,710
I know,but it's so hard. Nothing rhymes with your stupid name!
我知道 但是要找跟你那笨名字 押韻的東西太難了

112
00:07:26,310 --> 00:07:29,210
What are you talking about? Lots of things rhyme with Rachel:
跟瑞秋押韻的字多得很

113
00:07:29,480 --> 00:07:33,780
Bagel,mail,jail,bail,cable.
如貝果、信件 監獄、保釋金、第四台…

114
00:07:34,020 --> 00:07:35,450
Maypole.
五月節花柱…

115
00:07:36,780 --> 00:07:38,550
All good. Thanks.
那些都不錯，謝了

116
00:07:40,390 --> 00:07:43,980
Do you,maybe,have a nickname that's easier to rhyme?
你有沒有比較 容易押韻的外號？

117
00:07:44,230 --> 00:07:46,520
Didn't your dad used to call you "Pumpkin"?
你爸以前 不是常叫你小南瓜嗎？

118
00:07:46,760 --> 00:07:50,290
Pumpkin? But did he ever call you "Budolph"?
小南瓜不錯 但他有沒有叫過你布道夫？

119
00:07:53,800 --> 00:07:55,460
Hello,children.
大家好

120
00:07:56,240 --> 00:07:59,140
Have I got the 50 guys for you!
我幫你找了50個好男人

121
00:08:00,070 --> 00:08:02,980
-Really? -I showed them your picture.
我不過把你的照片亮給他們看

122
00:08:03,210 --> 00:08:06,180
Guys are throwing themselves at me and giving me stuff.
他們就窮拍我的馬屁 請我喝酒，送我東西

124
00:08:06,380 --> 00:08:08,180
-Knicks tonight? -Where are the seats?
今晚想不想看尼克隊的球賽？ 當然，第幾排？

125
00:08:08,420 --> 00:08:10,320
Wherever! I've got 20.
隨你挑，我有20張票

126
00:08:12,850 --> 00:08:14,410
Will I like any of these guys?
我會喜歡你幫我挑的男人嗎？

127
00:08:14,690 --> 00:08:16,590
You know,I'm going to...
我想...

128
00:08:16,820 --> 00:08:19,220
...play the field a little bit more.
...再多觀察一陣子 錢德

129
00:08:20,330 --> 00:08:23,590
Guys are signing over their 401 Ks to me.
他們對我簡直是 一個口令一個動作

130
00:08:24,600 --> 00:08:26,930
You work with robots?
你的同事都是機器人啊？

131
00:08:31,140 --> 00:08:32,870
Yes.
對

132
00:08:33,910 --> 00:08:38,240
One guy,Patrick,you'll like him. He's nice,funny and a swimmer.
你一定會喜歡我同事派崔克 他人好、風趣 還是個游泳高手

134
00:08:38,510 --> 00:08:40,210
I like swimmers' bodies.
我愛死游泳選手的體格了

135
00:08:40,410 --> 00:08:43,210
His dad made the magnetic strip on credit cards.
而且他老爸還發明了 信用卡背面的磁條

136
00:08:44,050 --> 00:08:45,990
I like credit cards!
我也愛死信用卡了

137
00:08:46,690 --> 00:08:48,280
I'm not bad at this!
我還蠻會當紅娘的

138
00:08:48,520 --> 00:08:51,050
-What does he do? -He works in fine foods.
他是做什麼的？ 他在美食部上班

139
00:08:51,390 --> 00:08:55,730
-You have a fine foods division? -It's a big company....
你們公司有美食部？ 敝公司很大…

140
00:08:55,960 --> 00:08:59,060
Now,wait a second. You make food and robots?
等等… 你們公司生產食物和機器人？

141
00:09:00,800 --> 00:09:03,900
No,the robots just work for them.
不是啦，機器人在那裡工作

142
00:09:05,170 --> 00:09:07,160
All right,I'm going to work.
我要去工作了

143
00:09:07,780 --> 00:09:09,710
Does anybody have a problem with that?
有人有意見嗎？

144
00:09:10,010 --> 00:09:12,070
Yeah,lady. I do!
小姐，我有意見

145
00:09:12,310 --> 00:09:13,370
I got a problem!
你想雞蛋裡挑骨頭 

146
00:09:13,610 --> 00:09:15,710
I'll give you a problem!
就別怪我不客氣了

147
00:09:16,280 --> 00:09:17,980
What will you do? Fire me?
你想怎樣？開除我？

148
00:09:18,220 --> 00:09:20,650
You bet your ass I'll fire you!
那還用說

149
00:09:20,920 --> 00:09:23,290
-See you later. -Thanks.
回頭見 謝謝

150
00:09:28,360 --> 00:09:30,730
I should go. I've got a date.
我得走了，今晚有約會

151
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:32,160
With who?
跟誰？

152
00:09:32,370 --> 00:09:35,340
You know the girl who lives in Poughkeepsie?
還記得那個住在 波啟浦夕的女孩嗎？

153
00:09:35,500 --> 00:09:36,900
Not her.
不是她

154
00:09:37,610 --> 00:09:39,400
This is someone else.
我又認識了一個女孩 

155
00:09:39,610 --> 00:09:42,080
I can't decide between the two.
現在左右為難

156
00:09:42,410 --> 00:09:46,740
The one from Poughkeepsie,though two hours away,is pretty...
波啟浦夕那個女孩雖然住得遠

157
00:09:46,980 --> 00:09:49,450
...really smart and a lot of fun.
但漂亮、聰明又有趣

158
00:09:49,650 --> 00:09:53,610
But this other girl, she lives right uptown.
但另一個女孩…就住在上城區

159
00:09:55,790 --> 00:09:58,090
She's just as pretty.
她也很漂亮

160
00:09:58,260 --> 00:10:00,090
I guess she's smart.
應該也蠻聰明的 

161
00:10:00,900 --> 00:10:02,490
She's not fun.
但是無趣得要命

162
00:10:04,330 --> 00:10:07,230
If she's no fun, why date her at all?
那你為什麼還要跟她約會？

163
00:10:07,500 --> 00:10:11,230
I want to give her a chance. She lives so close.
我想再給她一個機會 因為她家實在太近了

164
00:10:11,910 --> 00:10:16,100
And,at the end of the date, she said something that...
上次她說了一句話…

166
00:10:16,580 --> 00:10:19,410
...if she was kidding, was very funny.
若她在開玩笑就好笑到不行

167
00:10:19,810 --> 00:10:24,650
If she wasn't kidding,she's not fun. She's stupid and racist.
否則她不僅無聊、愚蠢 又有種族歧視

168
00:10:28,790 --> 00:10:31,850
How was your first day at the restaurant?
第一天在餐廳工作的 情況如何？

169
00:10:32,090 --> 00:10:33,920
Damn!
可惡

170
00:10:42,470 --> 00:10:44,530
What happened to your fancy jacket?
你的制服怎麼了？

171
00:10:44,810 --> 00:10:46,430
They baked it.
被他們烤了

172
00:10:46,870 --> 00:10:47,970
I can't take this anymore.
我再也受不了了

173
00:10:48,180 --> 00:10:50,870
-I'm going to fire you tonight. -You got it.
我今晚就要開除你 沒問題

174
00:10:52,110 --> 00:10:53,510
What are you doing?
你在幹嘛？

175
00:10:53,680 --> 00:10:55,810
You're still on fire there.
你衣服上還有火星

176
00:10:57,520 --> 00:10:59,380
I think you got it!
你應該已經拍滅了吧

177
00:11:03,920 --> 00:11:07,360
Chandler,you have the best taste in men.
錢德，你對男人的品味一流

178
00:11:08,530 --> 00:11:10,660
Like father,like son.
虎父無犬子嘛

179
00:11:11,700 --> 00:11:14,570
Patrick and I had such a great time last night!
派崔克和我昨晚玩得好開心

180
00:11:14,840 --> 00:11:17,100
This could,maybe,get serious.
說不定能發展出一段 認真的感情

181
00:11:17,570 --> 00:11:21,340
I thought you weren't looking for serious. Just a fling?
認真的感情？ 你不是要露水姻緣嗎？

182
00:11:21,580 --> 00:11:24,200
Well,you know,possibly.
有可能噢

183
00:11:26,780 --> 00:11:29,940
You didn't tell him that, though,right?
你沒告訴他吧？

184
00:11:30,289 --> 00:11:33,452
沒…有

185
00:11:34,260 --> 00:11:37,780
You told this guy that I was looking for a fling?
你告訴他 我想找一段露水姻緣？

186
00:11:38,030 --> 00:11:40,360
-You don't tell him that! -Why not?
你怎麼能告訴他？ 為什麼不行？

187
00:11:40,560 --> 00:11:42,790
I'd be thrilled if some hot girl
若某個辣妹只想來段露水姻緣 我高興都來不及…

188
00:11:43,030 --> 00:11:44,050
I see.
我明白了

189
00:11:45,870 --> 00:11:49,030
You telling him I want a fling and me putting out...
你告訴他我不打算認真

190
00:11:49,270 --> 00:11:52,140
...he's so going to get the wrong idea!
咱們第一次約會時 我又火力全開 他一定會誤會的

192
00:11:56,580 --> 00:11:58,600
Joey,could you pass the cheese?
喬伊，把乳酪拿來好嗎？

193
00:11:58,818 --> 00:11:59,978
行

194
00:12:00,820 --> 00:12:02,480
I'd prefer you didn't call me Joey.
可不可不要叫我喬伊？

195
00:12:02,780 --> 00:12:06,150
I thought it might be fun to try out a cool nickname.
因為我幫自己 取了個超炫的外號

196
00:12:06,390 --> 00:12:08,380
Hey,Dragon!
龍哥

197
00:12:09,290 --> 00:12:12,590
Here's your tips from Monday and Tuesday.
這是你這兩天賺的小費

198
00:12:13,730 --> 00:12:15,560
There's $300 in this one.
天啊，有三百塊耶

199
00:12:15,800 --> 00:12:18,230
People get generous around the holidays.
是啊 過節時客人總是特別大方

200
00:12:18,430 --> 00:12:21,800
And it never hurts to wear tight trousers.
穿緊身褲的效果更是棒到不行

201
00:12:24,270 --> 00:12:27,240
Could the waiters listen to the specials?
請服務生過來聽聽今晚的特餐

202
00:12:27,440 --> 00:12:31,310
There's Chilean sea bass with a mango relish
今晚有芒果醃鱸魚…

203
00:12:32,080 --> 00:12:33,550
Why is nobody writing these?
你們怎麼都不做筆記？

204
00:12:33,780 --> 00:12:35,080
We can remember them.
我們用背的就行了

205
00:12:35,380 --> 00:12:39,480
Because you'll make up fake specials and make me cook them?
還是要隨口亂謅好整我？

206
00:12:39,720 --> 00:12:42,380
Sure,that too.
那也行

207
00:12:43,820 --> 00:12:48,160
Forget the specials for a minute. Here's the thing....
特餐的事先別說了 是這樣的…

209
00:12:49,660 --> 00:12:51,760
For the last two weeks I have...
過去兩周...

210
00:12:52,830 --> 00:12:56,560
...tried hard to create a positive atmosphere.
...我試著想營造一個 愉快的工作環境

211
00:12:56,800 --> 00:12:58,270
Can't hear you!
聽不到！

212
00:13:00,240 --> 00:13:02,070
Positive atmosphere.
愉快的工作環境

213
00:13:02,280 --> 00:13:04,900
But I've had it up to here.
但是我的氣已經滿到這裡來了

214
00:13:08,520 --> 00:13:11,640
From now on, it is going to be my way...
從現在開始 不聽我話的人...

215
00:13:12,420 --> 00:13:15,510
...or the highway. All right?
...就滾蛋

216
00:13:16,460 --> 00:13:19,290
Does anybody have a problem with that?
有人有意見嗎？

217
00:13:28,000 --> 00:13:29,530
Hey,new guy.
菜鳥

218
00:13:30,170 --> 00:13:33,970
I said,does anybody have a problem with that?
我說有人有意見嗎？

219
00:13:35,440 --> 00:13:37,100
No,ma'am.
沒有

220
00:13:38,980 --> 00:13:41,350
He has a name. It's Dragon.
他有名字，他叫龍哥

221
00:13:43,220 --> 00:13:46,120
You want to know your name? Check your hat.
你想知道你的名字嗎？ 看看你的帽子

222
00:13:46,450 --> 00:13:48,680
We did the hat,right?
我們有在帽子上寫字吧？

223
00:13:50,220 --> 00:13:53,130
-What the hell just happened? -I am so sorry.
剛剛那是怎麼回事？ 真的很抱歉

224
00:13:53,390 --> 00:13:54,760
I was going to do it.
我真的很想配合你

225
00:13:54,960 --> 00:13:58,560
But I was standing there with $327 in one hand...
但我一手拿著327塊 

226
00:13:58,800 --> 00:14:02,130
...and $238 in the other. And I was thinking...
另一手拿著238塊...

227
00:14:02,340 --> 00:14:04,770
...it's been a long time since I had...
我很久沒拿到…

228
00:14:06,170 --> 00:14:08,840
...$327 plus $238!
327塊加238塊 這麼多錢了

229
00:14:10,280 --> 00:14:13,940
We had a deal! It's why you're here. I've got to fire you!
我們說好的 我用你就是為了開除你

230
00:14:14,320 --> 00:14:16,810
And I got to pay rent!
但是我得付房租

231
00:14:19,250 --> 00:14:20,950
How about you don't fire me.
這樣吧，你別開除我

232
00:14:21,220 --> 00:14:23,780
Instead,I stay. I gain their trust.
我留在這裡爭取他們的信任

233
00:14:24,060 --> 00:14:27,320
They'll listen to the nice things I say about you.
我說你的好話 他們就聽得進去了

234
00:14:28,760 --> 00:14:29,960
What nice things?
什麼好話？

235
00:14:30,260 --> 00:14:33,720
Nothing yet. They hate you, and I want to fit in.
還沒有，他們討厭死你了 我想跟他們打成一片

236
00:14:34,570 --> 00:14:38,000
Happy Hannukah,Chandler and Monica Merry,merry
錢德、摩妮卡，光明節快樂…聖誕…

237
00:14:38,240 --> 00:14:40,230
You know what,Pheebs?
菲比，你知道嗎？

239
00:14:41,340 --> 00:14:43,240
I'm not Jewish so....
我不是猶太人，所以…

240
00:14:43,780 --> 00:14:46,910
Ross doesn't decorate his tree with floss...
羅斯也不用牙線裝飾聖誕樹 

241
00:14:47,150 --> 00:14:49,140
...but he's not complaining.
你有聽到他抱怨嗎？

242
00:14:53,090 --> 00:14:54,680
Bad dream?
做惡夢啦？

243
00:14:55,420 --> 00:14:56,510
I wasn't sleeping.
我又沒在睡覺

244
00:14:58,290 --> 00:15:00,260
What was Phoebe's song about?
是嗎？ 那菲比剛剛在唱什麼歌？

245
00:15:01,700 --> 00:15:04,360
It's the one with the cat.
在唱那首貓歌

246
00:15:05,970 --> 00:15:09,030
I got to go. I've got another date.
我得走了，又有約

247
00:15:09,540 --> 00:15:10,940
Did you pick one yet?
你決定要挑哪一個了嗎？

248
00:15:11,240 --> 00:15:15,110
It turns out the one from uptown was making a joke.
沒有，上城區那個女孩 那次的確在開玩笑

249
00:15:15,710 --> 00:15:19,540
It was a different joke. It wasn't that funny.
但是和我想像中的不同 而且沒那麼好笑

250
00:15:20,580 --> 00:15:21,980
So I'm still torn.
我還是左右為難

251
00:15:22,250 --> 00:15:24,240
You don't like the one from uptown.
你並不喜歡上城區那個女孩

252
00:15:24,450 --> 00:15:27,250
And you're exhausted from dating Poughkeepsie.
為了跟波啟浦夕妞約會 又累得半死

253
00:15:27,550 --> 00:15:29,320
Just end them both!
把她們兩個都甩了

254
00:15:29,590 --> 00:15:32,250
Go to Poughkeepsie and break up with her.
坐火車去波啟浦夕跟她分手

255
00:15:32,460 --> 00:15:34,290
Then break up with uptown.
回程跟上城妞分手

256
00:15:34,500 --> 00:15:37,160
By the time you get home, you're done!
到家時一切都解決了

257
00:15:38,500 --> 00:15:40,430
You're right. Thank you.
你說得對，謝謝

258
00:15:41,470 --> 00:15:44,730
I had a similar problem when I lived in Prague.
我在布拉格也碰過這種問題

259
00:15:45,770 --> 00:15:48,800
-Prague? -So much you don't know.
布拉格？ 我的事你不知道的可多了

260
00:16:03,660 --> 00:16:05,780
Patrick just ended things with me.
派崔克剛剛跟我分手了

261
00:16:06,030 --> 00:16:11,090
Did you or didn't you tell him I wanted a serious relationship?
你有沒有告訴他 我想認真談段感情？

262
00:16:11,770 --> 00:16:13,490
I did! I absolutely did!
我有，我真的有

263
00:16:13,930 --> 00:16:15,490
You idiot!
你這個白癡

264
00:16:15,840 --> 00:16:18,070
I'm sure you're right. But why?
有道理，為什麼？

265
00:16:18,840 --> 00:16:23,170
You don't tell a guy that you want a serious relationship.
千萬不能告訴男人 你要談段認真的感情

266
00:16:23,510 --> 00:16:25,410
Now you scared him away!
你把他嚇跑了

267
00:16:25,610 --> 00:16:28,510
I am sorry. I am so sorry.
對不起…

268
00:16:28,780 --> 00:16:31,810
You should never be allowed to talk to people!
應該禁止你跟別人說話

269
00:16:32,690 --> 00:16:34,310
I know,I know!
我知道…

270
00:16:34,520 --> 00:16:37,580
Now I'm right back where I started.
我現在又回到原點了

271
00:16:37,860 --> 00:16:39,330
This sucks!
粉難過

272
00:16:39,530 --> 00:16:41,590
Being alone sucks!
孤孤單單的真難過

273
00:16:42,300 --> 00:16:44,200
You'll meet somebody.
你遲早會遇見意中人

274
00:16:44,470 --> 00:16:46,330
You're a great catch!
你棒呆了

275
00:16:46,600 --> 00:16:51,440
When I told those guys about you, I didn't have to lie once.
我跟同事形容你時 一句謊話都沒說

276
00:16:52,770 --> 00:16:54,100
Really?
真的嗎？

277
00:16:55,380 --> 00:16:57,840
You graduated magna cum laude,right?
你畢業時 有拿優秀畢業生獎吧？

278
00:17:00,010 --> 00:17:02,010
It doesn't matter.
沒有 不要緊

279
00:17:04,490 --> 00:17:08,680
I got tickets to the Ranger game. You want to come with me?
我有兩張今晚球賽的門票 要不要跟我去看？

280
00:17:09,620 --> 00:17:11,780
Cute guys in little shorts?
看猛男穿短褲滿場飛？

281
00:17:11,990 --> 00:17:13,320
Sure.
當然要去

282
00:17:14,630 --> 00:17:19,360
Actually,it's a hockey team. Angry Canadians with no teeth.
今晚是冰上曲棍球賽 你只能看到 沒牙的暴躁加拿大佬

284
00:17:19,570 --> 00:17:22,090
That sounds fun too. Thank you.
好像挺好玩的，謝謝

285
00:17:22,240 --> 00:17:24,230
Okay.

286
00:17:27,240 --> 00:17:29,570
Have you ever been with a woman?
你有跟女人在一起過嗎？

287
00:17:31,010 --> 00:17:34,670
What? What is the matter with you?
什麼？ 你有毛病

289
00:17:34,920 --> 00:17:38,510
There is no good time to ask that question.
不管什麼時候問這個問題 都會被人罵

290
00:17:42,020 --> 00:17:45,750
The station is Poughkeepsie. Poughkeepsie!
下一站是波啟浦夕…

291
00:17:47,860 --> 00:17:51,320
Ross? Ross?
羅斯？ 羅斯？

293
00:17:51,600 --> 00:17:53,330
Wake up!
醒醒

295
00:18:02,310 --> 00:18:04,000
I need more swordfish.
再拿點魚來

296
00:18:05,310 --> 00:18:08,770
-Can you get me more swordfish? -I don't speak English.
能不能再拿點魚來？ 我不講英文

297
00:18:10,080 --> 00:18:13,610
-You just did. -I don't know what to tell you.
你剛講的就是英文 這下我啞口無言了

299
00:18:14,860 --> 00:18:16,320
Fine.
好吧

300
00:18:24,670 --> 00:18:28,000
Okay. Very funny.
很幽默

302
00:18:29,200 --> 00:18:30,430
Let me out,please.
快放我出來

303
00:18:30,900 --> 00:18:32,960
Come on,I'm cold!
裡面好冷

304
00:18:35,310 --> 00:18:38,210
And covered in marinara sauce!
而且全身都是醬汁

305
00:18:38,580 --> 00:18:39,810
Let me out!
放我出去

306
00:18:44,080 --> 00:18:46,280
You found that handle,did you?
找到把手啦？

307
00:18:48,260 --> 00:18:51,250
-It's not funny. -Well,that's not true.
不好笑 怎麼不好笑？

308
00:18:53,460 --> 00:18:56,730
I'm a good person. And I'm a good chef.
我是個好人，也是個好廚師

309
00:18:56,930 --> 00:19:00,990
And I don't deserve to have marinara sauce all over me!
我不該被弄得全身都是醬汁

310
00:19:01,270 --> 00:19:03,960
If you want me to quit this bad then
若你們這麼希望我辭職…

311
00:19:05,110 --> 00:19:06,090
Chef Geller?
蓋勒主廚

312
00:19:06,940 --> 00:19:08,840
You know that speech you made?
還記得那天你講的那段話嗎？

313
00:19:09,310 --> 00:19:11,300
I got a problem with it!
我有意見

314
00:19:14,010 --> 00:19:16,180
-You do? -You bet I do!
是嗎？ 沒錯

315
00:19:17,150 --> 00:19:20,810
I just wasn't listening then, that's all.
只是我那時沒專心聽

316
00:19:22,360 --> 00:19:26,350
If you want a problem, I'll give you a problem!
你想雞蛋裡挑骨頭 就別怪我不客氣了

317
00:19:27,360 --> 00:19:29,520
What are you going to do? Fire me?
你想怎樣？開除我？

318
00:19:29,830 --> 00:19:33,630
You bet I'll fire you! Get out of my kitchen!
那還用說，滾出我的廚房！

319
00:19:33,970 --> 00:19:35,700
Get out!
滾！

320
00:19:38,910 --> 00:19:39,900
All right.
這才像話

321
00:19:40,970 --> 00:19:42,740
Anybody else got a problem?
還有誰有意見？

322
00:19:43,240 --> 00:19:45,270
How about you,chuckles?
你沒有意見？

323
00:19:45,750 --> 00:19:47,940
You think this is funny now?
你現在還覺得好笑嗎？

325
00:19:49,620 --> 00:19:54,080
What if I dance covered in sauce? You think it's funny?
我全身沾滿醬汁跳舞… 好不好笑？

326
00:19:55,120 --> 00:19:56,820
No,it's really good.
不，你跳得很好

327
00:19:58,160 --> 00:20:00,820
Take those salads to table four.
沙拉送去給四號桌的客人

328
00:20:01,160 --> 00:20:02,820
And you,get the swordfish!
你去幫我拿魚

329
00:20:03,160 --> 00:20:04,490
And you!
還有你…

330
00:20:04,830 --> 00:20:06,490
Get a haircut!
去剪頭髮

331
00:20:09,440 --> 00:20:14,240
Last stop,Montreal. The stop is Montreal!
終點站蒙特婁…

332
00:20:17,140 --> 00:20:18,910
What?
什麼？

333
00:20:22,980 --> 00:20:26,320
I bet myself that you had beautiful eyes.
我跟自己打賭 賭你有一對美目

334
00:20:26,620 --> 00:20:29,020
Now that I see them,I win!
看來…我贏了

336
00:20:34,530 --> 00:20:37,690
We're at my stop. Would you like to have coffee?
我要在這站下車 你想不想喝杯咖啡？

337
00:20:41,940 --> 00:20:43,660
Are we really in Montreal?
我們真的在蒙特婁嗎？ 

338
00:20:44,100 --> 00:20:45,260
Yes,we are.
對

339
00:20:45,970 --> 00:20:47,000
So coffee?
想不想喝咖啡？

340
00:20:49,210 --> 00:20:50,700
Coffee sounds great.
好主意

341
00:20:53,380 --> 00:20:54,680
Wait.
等等

342
00:20:54,880 --> 00:20:56,850
So you live in Montreal?
你住在蒙特婁？

343
00:20:57,050 --> 00:21:00,710
No,but it's only a two-hour ferry ride to Nova Scotia.
不，我住新斯科細亞省 坐渡輪兩小時就到了

344
00:21:04,190 --> 00:21:06,850
I should have thought about my wife and kids...
在我頂嘴之前 

345
00:21:07,060 --> 00:21:09,360
...before I talked back to Chef Geller.
真該想想家中妻小

346
00:21:12,030 --> 00:21:16,230
It will be a lean Christmas at the Dragon house this year.
謝了 看來咱們龍府今年得過個 冷颼颼的聖誕節

348
00:21:19,370 --> 00:21:20,740
Enough!
夠了

349
00:21:22,180 --> 00:21:24,700
Lean,lean,lean!
冷颼颼啊

350
00:21:27,180 --> 00:21:30,480
So this is a very special holiday song...
接下來是我為...

351
00:21:30,620 --> 00:21:34,380
...that I wrote for some very important people to me.
...幾位好朋友 寫的聖誕歌

352
00:21:37,320 --> 00:21:40,450
Went to the store Sat on Santa's lap
我去店裡坐在聖誕老公公膝頭

353
00:21:40,690 --> 00:21:43,820
Asked him to bring my friends All kinds of crap
要他送堆禮物給我朋友

354
00:21:45,530 --> 00:21:48,990
Said all you need is To write them a song
他說你只需要幫他們寫首歌

355
00:21:49,340 --> 00:21:53,170
Now you haven't heard it yet So don't try to sing along
這首歌你們沒聽過 別想跟著我唱

356
00:21:54,040 --> 00:21:56,480
No,don't sing along
不要跟我唱

357
00:21:57,180 --> 00:21:59,870
Monica,Monica
摩妮卡…

358
00:22:00,250 --> 00:22:03,340
Have a happy Hannukah
光明節快樂

359
00:22:04,750 --> 00:22:07,220
Saw Santa Claus
我看到聖誕老公公

360
00:22:07,490 --> 00:22:10,890
He said hello to Ross
他要我跟羅斯說哈羅

361
